</div>
<div class="note hidden" id="degraded">
  The last reading did not complete — showing the previous numbers, which may be up to a minute old.
</div>

<div id="body" class="">
  <div class="stats" id="stats"><div class="stat"><div class="k">Attributed CPU</div><div class="v">—</div><div class="n">measuring</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="k">Attributed RSS</div><div class="v">—</div><div class="n">measuring</div></div><div class="stat"><div class="k">Proven waste</div><div class="v">0</div><div class="n">findings</div></div></div>
  <div class="summaryMeta" id="summaryMeta">0 attributed roots · 0 unattributed shown</div>

  <div class="gridTop">
    <div class="panel">
