  </div>
  <div class="actions">
    <button type="button" class="k-btn k-btn--secondary" id="refreshBtn">Refresh</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="note plain" id="unsupported">
  Resource monitoring is not supported on this platform. The status-bar meter is hidden; nothing here is measured.
</div>
<div class="note hidden" id="degraded">
  The last reading did not complete — showing the previous numbers, which may be up to a minute old.
</div>

<div id="body" class="hidden">
  <div class="stats" id="stats"></div>
  <div class="summaryMeta" id="summaryMeta"></div>

  <div class="gridTop">
